  class lg0 breaks
  class lg1 bugPath
  s0: Not recording | gate off in the page
  s1: Not recording | gate off in the page | navigation under way | click 1: reached the page#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s2: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way) | navigation under way | click 1: reached the page#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s3: Recording | gate ON in the page | navigation under way | click 1: reached the page#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s4: Recording | gate ON in the page | navigation under way | click 1: reached the page#59; no report#59; not in the timeline | click 2: held back, no 'before' yet#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s5: Recording | gate ON in the page | navigation under way | click 1: reached the page#59; no report#59; not in the timeline | click 2: held back, 'before' taken#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s6: Recording | gate ON in the page | on the new page | click 1: reached the page#59; no report#59; not in the timeline | click 2: held back, 'before' taken#59; no report#59; not in the timeline
  s7: Recording | gate ON in the page | on the new page | click 1: reached the page#59; no report#59; not in the timeline | click 2: reached the NEW page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you click (click 1): it reaches the page untouched and starts a navigation
  s1 --> s2: you press Record
  s2 --> s3: the page switches the gate on
  s3 --> s4: you click (click 2): the gate holds it back
  s4 --> s5: the recorder takes the 'before' of click 2
  s5 --> s6: the new page loads
  s6 --> s7: the recorder passes click 2 on to the page (the NEW page)
